        <argsstring></argsstring>
        <name>snapshot_ts</name>
        <qualifiedname>themis::aql::LLMQueryContext::snapshot_ts</qualifiedname>
        <briefdescription>
<para>HLC timestamp that anchors all DB reads for this LLM request. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>All vector, graph, and relational retrievals contributing to the prompt must read data committed at or before this timestamp. A zero-value timestamp means &quot;use the latest committed version&quot; (consistent with default RocksDB snapshot behaviour). </para>
        </detaileddescription>
