    <briefdescription>
<para>Snapshot context for a single LLM inference request. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Binds all DB reads that contribute to the LLM prompt to a single HLC read-timestamp, enforcing snapshot isolation in the retrieval phase. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
